title: "GH-768: deduplicate public SDK provenance exports across core and root entrypoints"
description: "CodeFactor reports a new duplicate block at merged commit b76167b between src/sdk/core.ts and src/sdk/index.ts. The same provenance and completeness export list is manually restated across public SDK tiers, creating drift risk in the architecture boundary. Establish one source-owned export manifest or narrower module boundary while preserving every documented subpath and exact public-surface snapshot."
